  "reasoning": "The defendant raised funds from a large number of non‑specific investors by promising high monthly interest rates and using his factories as collateral, without any governmental or financial approval. He misrepresented the ability to repay, used the money for personal consumption, and caused huge losses. The prosecution explicitly states that he used fraudulent methods to illegally raise funds (使用诈骗方法非法集资) and the amount is especially large. According to the guidance, this fits the definition of 集资诈骗 (fraudulent fundraising), rather than merely illegal public deposit collection, because the conduct involved intentional deception for personal gain.",
